dn16:6.28.1 starts: Eight portions were the relics
dn16:6.28.2 starts: seven honored in Jambudīpa,
dn16:6.28.3 starts: and one in Rāmagāma
dn16:6.28.4 starts: honored by kings of the nāgas.
dn16:6.28.9 starts: These, with their splendor,
dn16:6.28.10 starts: embellish this wealth-bearing earth.
